# AngelSlim vistoken: visual row compression for the EAGLE-3 draft.
#
# Applies on top of vllm-v0.25.0-eagle3-progressive-staged.patch (it reuses that
# patch's compact-prefill machinery) and -smolvlm-eagle3.patch.
#
# What it does, all inside the speculator:
#   1. On the raw aux concat -- before the band mix / fc, the same order training
#      uses -- compress each image tile's 64 rows to k summaries and write them
#      into k fixed slots of that tile.
#   2. Record which rows the compact prefill keeps (text rows + those slots).
#      HiViS's compact path then runs the whole draft stack on them, so the
#      drafter attends over ~15 image rows instead of ~900.
#   3. Add the trained row-embedding delta on the surviving <image> rows.
#
# The compressor module itself is imported from AngelSlim, so training and
# decode run identical code, and vLLM's weight loader is untouched.
#
# Auto-arms whenever the draft config carries `vistoken_compress`.
# VLLM_EAGLE_VISTOKEN=0 disables it.
